# .gitignore — OreSat ACS reaction-wheel firmware
# STM32G474VEHX, dual-managed: STM32CubeIDE (Eclipse CDT) + CMake/CLion.
#
# Deliberately TRACKED — do NOT add these. They look generated but are source-of-truth:
#   .cproject .project .mxproject oresat-acs-fw-v8.ioc  → CubeIDE/CubeMX project (regen source)
#   CMakeLists.txt + CMakeLists_template.txt            → CMakeLists.txt is generated FROM the
#                                                         template, but both are committed
#   *.ld  openocd.cfg  stm32g474.svd              → linker scripts, OpenOCD cfg, SVD reg defs
#   OD/OD.{c,h}                                          → generated from the EDS, but committed
#   resources/                                          → vendor PDFs + grep indexes; the CLAUDE.md
#                                                         lookup workflow depends on them being present

# ---- Build output: CMake / CLion (out-of-tree) ----
cmake-build*/
/build/
# In-tree CMake leftovers, in case anyone configures inside the source tree
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
/compile_commands.json

# ---- Pinned toolchain (toolchain.sh), release packaging (tools/dist.sh), release flasher ----
/.toolchain/
/dist/
/releases/
/backups/

# ---- Build output: STM32CubeIDE (build configs live at the project root) ----
/Debug/
/Release/
.metadata/

# ---- Compiled firmware & toolchain artifacts ----
# Normally confined to the build dirs above; globbed here as a guard against stray in-tree output.
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.d
*.su
*.lst
*.gcno
*.gcda
*.gcov

# ---- Debug / flashing logs ----
*.log
openocd.log
.gdb_history

# ---- JetBrains (CLion / IntelliJ) ----
# .idea/ is intentionally NOT blanket-ignored. JetBrains maintains .idea/.gitignore, which already
# excludes the user-specific files (workspace.xml, shelf/, dataSources) while keeping shareable
# project config (modules, code style, embedded debug-server setup) tracked.
# Want to ignore the whole thing instead? Replace this block with a single line:  /.idea/

# ---- Other editors / tools ----
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
\#*\#
.\#*
tags
TAGS
.cache/

# ---- Claude Code (claude.ai/code) ----
# Session state and isolated worktrees live here (e.g. .claude/worktrees/*); never commit them.
.claude/

# ---- Python (resources/build_index.py tooling) ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ---- OS cruft ----
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.directory
.fuse_hidden*
.Trash-*

# ---- Patch / backup scratch ----
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*.tmp
